  "content": "<h2>需要 Vanilla Backport 和 Farmer's Delight</h2>\n<p>此模组/datapack 为 Vanilla Backport 和 Farmer's Delight 添加兼容性，使蓝鸡蛋和棕鸡蛋可煎成荷包蛋。</p>\n<p>蓝鸡蛋和棕鸡蛋现在可在烟熏炉、熔炉、營火和爐灶（以及平底鍋）中烹煮。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f6fac218-8081-43ec-89ab-3fcbb00df817.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3658d90d-484d-4bfa-8cfc-953fa696a225.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>NeoForge 1.21.1 模組版本中，Pale Oak 現在擁有自己的櫥櫃</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1560060/description_6e7c4336-bf42-4de3-a79d-4d0af16942b7.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
